    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "NODC Accession 0117691 includes chemical, discrete sample, physical and profile data collected from OCEANUS in the North Atlantic Ocean from 1983-05-01 to 1983-05-17 and retrieved during cruise 32OC19830501. These data include DISSOLVED OXYGEN, HYDROSTATIC PRESSURE, NITRATE, NITRITE, PHOSPHATE, Potential temperature (theta), SALINITY, SILICATE and WATER TEMPERATURE. The instruments used to collect these data include CTD and bottle. These data were collected by Mike McCartney of Scripps Institution of Oceanography as part of the GLODAPv2_32OC19830501 data set.",
